    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-100">
            <h1 class="doc-h1">Health Kitchen Plan</h1>
            <p class="doc-muted">Last Updated | Version 0.02 | Status: DECISIONS LOCKED — tracking live on #296</p>
            <p class="doc-body">
                Working checklist (not served by Documentation):
                <code class="doc-code">.hermes/plans/2026-09-23_100015-health-kitchen.md</code>
                in the ency worktree git root.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-100">
            <h2 id="now" class="doc-h2">Now</h2>
            <div class="doc-info">
                <ul class="doc-body">
                    <li><strong>Current.</strong> D1–D5 decided. Project
                        <a href="[% c.uri_for('/project/details') %]?project_id=296" class="doc-link">#296 HEALTHKITCHEN</a>
                        is live under #227. No Health Kitchen routes or tables yet.</li>
                    <li><strong>Blocked by.</strong> Nothing on decisions. Next work is HK-ENABLE.0 ROLE EVAL
                        <a href="[% c.uri_for('/todo/details') %]?record_id=2450" class="doc-link">todo #2450</a>.</li>
                    <li><strong>Next.</strong> Start #2450, then catalog key + member self-serve grant.</li>
                    <li><strong>Do not confuse.</strong>
                        <a href="[% c.uri_for('/project/details') %]?project_id=199" class="doc-link">#199 HEALTH-PLAN</a>
                        is server/application monitoring, not human health.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <p class="doc-backtop"><a href="#toc">&#8593; Back to Top</a></p>
        </div>
