    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-100">
            <h2 id="decisions" class="doc-h2">10. Decisions</h2>
            <p class="doc-body">Locked 2026-09-23 from the user’s answers. Cost of each choice is named.</p>
            <table class="doc-table">
                <tr>
                    <th class="doc-th">#</th>
                    <th class="doc-th">Decision</th>
                    <th class="doc-th">Resolution</th>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="doc-td">D1</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">Pantry ownership</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">DECIDED 2026-09-23 — both. Personal per-user overlay so any member can have a private kitchen (including a one-username site — still truly personal). Sitename inventory remains for household/site stock. Cost: extra UserPantryQty table and UI to show overlay vs site stock.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="doc-tr-alt">
                    <td class="doc-td">D2</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">Module catalog key</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">DECIDED 2026-09-23 — <code class="doc-code">healthkitchen</code>.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="doc-td">D3</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">Culinary foods in ENCY</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">DECIDED 2026-09-23 — no ency_food_tb. Reuse Herb + culinary + Organism, and allow pantry links to the wider ENCY graph (animals, birds, insects, organisms) so foods are not herb-only. Cost: InventoryEncyMap has nullable FKs beyond herb_id.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="doc-tr-alt">
                    <td class="doc-td">D4</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">Clinical scope</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">DECIDED 2026-09-23 — wellness/culinary planner only. Do not promote medications that interfere with health. Never suggest stopping prescribed drugs. Cost: planner will omit or warn on drug–herb conflicts rather than “treat” them.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="doc-td">D5</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">Tracking project</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">DECIDED 2026-09-23 — child HEALTHKITCHEN #296 under #227. Cost: one more project row; #227 stays the domain parent.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="doc-tr-alt">
                    <td class="doc-td">D6</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">Accounting optional</td>
                    <td class="doc-td">DECIDED 2026-09-23 — Health Kitchen does not require the accounting package. Member-only: personal pantry + Health Kitchen need-buy list. Site with inventory enabled (Shanta test): Mark recipe as made deducts inventory_items (transaction_type use) so the inventory short list can reorder. Mail invoice classifier stays on InventoryAccounting and is never shown to pantry-only users. Reuse ency_recipe / ency_recipe_line (food_recipe), do not add a second recipe table.</td>
                </tr>
            </table>
            <p class="doc-backtop"><a href="#toc">&#8593; Back to Top</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>

